Z||000012||JSocha||11-22-2001||10:13 PM||||Geeze! Lousie!  That's deep!<P>In nonsensical (sp?) red tape that is...<P><B>PRE-WARNING:</B>  I am not going to run this through the spell checker after I am done typing as I am tired, trying to get caught up with the forum before I go to bed.<P>However, I've been kinda wondering about this myself regarding this forum.  <P>Since you know who had been removed or booted off the island (who could have problably answered this  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"> and filled us with all kinds of legal advise regarding this topic), if he has been sending "legal" threats to Cliff to a lawsuit for discrimination or wrongfull termination/banishment or some other  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_bs.gif"> like that.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>I could understand your forum moderator censoring things like racial/ethnic slurs or sexual enuendos for fear of reprisal from memebers that it would offend since you have a larger population, perhaps with less tolerance and the legal means through the government.<P>However, to go that overboard...well...just a little too paranoid if you ask me.<P>I mean, whoever is running and moderating the forum, if he was running a bar where you were all meeting, would he kick you out or be censoring your discussions and telling you you can't talk about that, because they might get sued if he allows that kind of talk within his establishment?<P>The guy would certainly go broke in a hurry, because I'm sure you would all take your business elsewhere so you could talk freely about any subject you wish to.<P>But here is something to ponder.  If your forum is actually being held/hosted on a Government server, perhaps, yes, its good that they do have such rules so it doesn't come back to the GOV and subsequently to the forum moderator/owner.<P>However, IMO, if its hosted by an "independent" who just wanted to have something out there for other military members to meet with similar backgrounds/interests (like what Cliff does here at PFF), then he is operating it separately where many thoughts are going to converge to which would be out of his control.<P>Just my thoughts on it.<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jsocha_2.gif"> ||||reg||1
